               <title>Inactive Ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Alumina, Butylene Glycol, Citric Acid, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Iron Oxide, Isopropyl Palmitate, Lecithin, Linoleic Acid, Hydrogen Dimethicone, Octyl Stearate, Octyldodecyl Neopentanoate, Oleth-3 Phosphate, Perfluorononyl Dimethicone, Phenoxyethanol, Polyacrylate 13, Polyisobutene, Polysorbate 20, Purified Water, Quercitin, Sodium Hydroxide, Thioctic Acid, Triethoxycaprylylsilane</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20181029"/>
            </section>
